<title>INDIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA ALL OUT FOR 234 IN SECOND INNINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA ALL OUT FOR 234 IN SECOND INNINGS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia were all out for 234</p>
<p>in their second innings of the single cricket test against India</p>
<p>on Sunday, leaving India needing 56 runs to win.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Australia 182 and 234 (S.Waugh 67 not out, M.Taylor 37,</p>
<p>M.Bevan 33, M.Waugh 23, A.Kumble 5-67, V.Prasad 3-18).</p>
<p>India 361.</p>
</text>
